#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/stretch_clusters.rst:114
msgid "Common failures include:"
msgstr "Los fallos comunes incluyen:"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/stretch_clusters.rst:116
msgid ""
"**Worker active but witness unreachable:** The Worker can reach the "
"Manager, but Hosts cannot reach the Worker URL. Correct DNS, routing, "
"firewall, load-balancer, or certificate trust."
msgstr ""
"**Worker activo pero testigo inaccesible:** El Worker puede alcanzar el "
"Manager, pero los Hosts no pueden alcanzar la Worker URL. Corrija DNS, "
"enrutamiento, firewall, balanceador de carga o confianza del certificado."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/stretch_clusters.rst:117
msgid ""
"**Witness absent from quorum:** Confirm the cluster has an HPE Shared "
"File System (GFS2) datastore and the Worker is selected in the cluster "
"Witness field."
msgstr ""
"**Testigo ausente del quórum:** Confirme que el clúster tiene un almacén "
"de datos HPE Shared File System (GFS2) y que el Worker está seleccionado "
"en el campo Witness del clúster."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/stretch_clusters.rst:118
msgid ""
"**Certificate error:** Install a certificate trusted by every Host or "
"correct the certificate chain served by the Worker or load balancer."
msgstr ""
"**Error de certificado:** Instale un certificado en el que confíe cada "
"Host o corrija la cadena de certificados servida por el Worker o el "
"balanceador de carga."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/stretch_clusters.rst:119
msgid ""
"**Wrong URL:** Set the Distributed Worker record's Worker URL to the "
"client-facing Worker endpoint, not the |morpheus| appliance URL."
msgstr ""
"**URL incorrecta:** Configure la Worker URL del registro Distributed "
"Worker con el endpoint Worker orientado al cliente, no con la URL del "
"dispositivo |morpheus|."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/stretch_clusters.rst:120
msgid ""
"**Stretch assignment conflict:** Add the witness after cluster deployment"
" and do not manually create a ``siteWitness`` group."
msgstr ""
"**Conflicto de asignación stretch:** Agregue el testigo después del "
"despliegue del clúster y no cree manualmente un grupo ``siteWitness``."

