#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/stretch_clusters.rst:183
msgid "NFS-Based Stretch Clusters"
msgstr "Clústers stretch basados en NFS"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/stretch_clusters.rst:185
msgid ""
"As an alternative to HPE Clustered Datastores (shared LUN), stretch "
"clusters can use **NFS-backed storage** with multipath connectivity. This"
" approach is simpler to configure because it does not require Corosync, "
"DLM, or the quorum/arbitration services — NFS handles concurrent access "
"at the protocol level."
msgstr ""
"Como alternativa a HPE Clustered Datastores (LUN compartido), los "
"clústers stretch pueden usar **almacenamiento respaldado por NFS** con "
"conectividad multipath. Este enfoque es más sencillo de configurar porque"
" no requiere Corosync, DLM ni los servicios de quórum/arbitraje — NFS "
"gestiona el acceso concurrente a nivel de protocolo."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/stretch_clusters.rst:188
msgid "When to Use NFS for Stretch"
msgstr "Cuándo usar NFS para stretch"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/stretch_clusters.rst:190
msgid "NFS-backed stretch clusters are appropriate when:"
msgstr "Los clústers stretch respaldados por NFS son apropiados cuando:"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/stretch_clusters.rst:192
msgid ""
"You already have enterprise NFS infrastructure (e.g., NetApp, Pure "
"Storage, Dell PowerScale) with multipath or multi-site replication"
msgstr ""
"Ya dispone de infraestructura NFS empresarial (p. ej., NetApp, Pure "
"Storage, Dell PowerScale) con multipath o replicación multisitio"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/stretch_clusters.rst:193
msgid ""
"You want to avoid the complexity of Corosync/DLM fencing and quorum "
"management"
msgstr ""
"Desea evitar la complejidad del fencing Corosync/DLM y la gestión de "
"quórum"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/stretch_clusters.rst:194
msgid ""
"Your NFS appliance provides its own high availability (active/passive "
"failover, synchronous replication across sites)"
msgstr ""
"Su appliance NFS proporciona su propia alta disponibilidad (conmutación "
"por error activo/pasivo, replicación síncrona entre sitios)"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/stretch_clusters.rst:195
msgid "You need a simpler operational model with fewer moving parts"
msgstr "Necesita un modelo operativo más simple con menos componentes móviles"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/stretch_clusters.rst:199
msgid ""
"The tradeoff is that HA behavior depends on the NFS appliance's own "
"failover capabilities rather than the cluster-managed quorum system. "
"Ensure your NFS infrastructure provides the level of availability your "
"workloads require."
msgstr ""
"La contrapartida es que el comportamiento de HA depende de las propias "
"capacidades de conmutación por error del appliance NFS en lugar del "
"sistema de quórum gestionado por el clúster. Asegúrese de que su "
"infraestructura NFS proporcione el nivel de disponibilidad que requieren "
"sus cargas de trabajo."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/stretch_clusters.rst:211
msgid "Minimum 2 hosts (1 per site for basic stretch, more for capacity)"
msgstr "Mínimo 2 hosts (1 por sitio para stretch básico, más para capacidad)"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/stretch_clusters.rst:212
msgid "NFS Storage"
msgstr "Almacenamiento NFS"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/stretch_clusters.rst:213
msgid ""
"Enterprise NFS appliance accessible from all hosts at both sites with "
"multipath or replicated access"
msgstr ""
"Appliance NFS empresarial accesible desde todos los hosts en ambos sitios"
" con acceso multipath o replicado"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/stretch_clusters.rst:215
msgid ""
"All hosts must reach the NFS endpoint(s). Low-latency cross-site links "
"are recommended for write-heavy workloads."
msgstr ""
"Todos los hosts deben alcanzar los endpoints NFS. Se recomiendan enlaces "
"de baja latencia entre sitios para cargas de trabajo con muchas "
"escrituras."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/stretch_clusters.rst:217
msgid ""
"Optional. A witness is not strictly required since there is no Corosync "
"quorum to arbitrate, but can still be configured for |morpheus|-level "
"site awareness."
msgstr ""
"Opcional. Un testigo no es estrictamente necesario porque no hay quórum "
"Corosync que arbitrar, pero aún puede configurarse para la conciencia de "
"sitio a nivel de |morpheus|."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/stretch_clusters.rst:221
msgid ""
"NFS storage must be presented as a single mountable endpoint (or a pair "
"of endpoints for multipath) that is accessible from both sites "
"simultaneously. If your NFS solution uses synchronous replication between"
" sites, ensure both sites mount the same namespace."
msgstr ""
"El almacenamiento NFS debe presentarse como un endpoint montable único (o"
" un par de endpoints para multipath) accesible desde ambos sitios "
"simultáneamente. Si su solución NFS usa replicación síncrona entre "
"sitios, asegúrese de que ambos sitios monten el mismo espacio de nombres."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/stretch_clusters.rst:224
msgid "Cluster Setup with NFS Storage"
msgstr "Configuración del clúster con almacenamiento NFS"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/stretch_clusters.rst:226
msgid ""
"Deploy the HVM cluster following the standard process (see "
":doc:`building_clusters`)"
msgstr ""
"Despliegue el clúster HVM siguiendo el proceso estándar (consulte "
":doc:`building_clusters`)"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/stretch_clusters.rst:227
msgid ""
"When configuring storage, choose **NFS Pool** rather than HPE Clustered "
"Datastore"
msgstr ""
"Al configurar el almacenamiento, elija **NFS Pool** en lugar de HPE "
"Clustered Datastore"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/stretch_clusters.rst:228
msgid "Add the NFS datastore to the cluster:"
msgstr "Agregue el almacén de datos NFS al clúster:"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/stretch_clusters.rst:230
msgid "Navigate to ``Infrastructure > Clusters > [Cluster] > Storage``"
msgstr "Vaya a ``Infrastructure > Clusters > [Cluster] > Storage``"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/stretch_clusters.rst:231
msgid "Click :guilabel:`Add Datastore`"
msgstr "Haga clic en :guilabel:`Add Datastore`"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/stretch_clusters.rst:232
msgid "Select **NFS** as the type"
msgstr "Seleccione **NFS** como tipo"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/stretch_clusters.rst:233
msgid "Enter the NFS server address and export path"
msgstr "Introduzca la dirección del servidor NFS y la ruta de exportación"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/stretch_clusters.rst:234
msgid "The NFS mount is configured on all hosts in the cluster automatically"
msgstr "El montaje NFS se configura automáticamente en todos los hosts del clúster"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/stretch_clusters.rst:236
msgid ""
"If stretching across sites, ensure the NFS endpoint is reachable from "
"hosts at both sites before adding hosts from the second site"
msgstr ""
"Si hace stretch entre sitios, asegúrese de que el endpoint NFS sea "
"accesible desde los hosts en ambos sitios antes de agregar hosts del "
"segundo sitio"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/stretch_clusters.rst:239
msgid "Adding Hosts at the Second Site"
msgstr "Agregar hosts en el segundo sitio"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/stretch_clusters.rst:241
msgid "Once the cluster is running with NFS storage at the primary site:"
msgstr ""
"Una vez que el clúster esté en ejecución con almacenamiento NFS en el "
"sitio primario:"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/stretch_clusters.rst:243
msgid ""
"Prepare additional HVM hosts at the second site (see "
":doc:`/getting_started/installation/hvm_host_prep`)"
msgstr ""
"Prepare hosts HVM adicionales en el segundo sitio (consulte "
":doc:`/getting_started/installation/hvm_host_prep`)"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/stretch_clusters.rst:244
msgid "Ensure the NFS endpoint is mountable from the second site hosts"
msgstr ""
"Asegúrese de que el endpoint NFS sea montable desde los hosts del segundo"
" sitio"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/stretch_clusters.rst:245
msgid ""
"Add the hosts to the existing cluster: ``Infrastructure > Clusters > "
"[Cluster] > Actions > Add Host``"
msgstr ""
"Agregue los hosts al clúster existente: ``Infrastructure > Clusters > "
"[Cluster] > Actions > Add Host``"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/stretch_clusters.rst:246
msgid ""
"|morpheus| will configure the new hosts and mount the NFS datastore "
"automatically"
msgstr ""
"|morpheus| configurará los nuevos hosts y montará el almacén de datos NFS"
" automáticamente"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/stretch_clusters.rst:248
msgid ""
"Workloads can now be migrated between hosts across sites using Live "
"Migration, provided the NFS storage is accessible from both source and "
"destination hosts."
msgstr ""
"Las cargas de trabajo pueden migrarse ahora entre hosts de distintos "
"sitios mediante migración en vivo, siempre que el almacenamiento NFS sea "
"accesible desde los hosts de origen y destino."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/stretch_clusters.rst:251
msgid "Multipath NFS Configuration"
msgstr "Configuración de multipath NFS"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/stretch_clusters.rst:253
msgid ""
"For resilient NFS access across sites, configure multipath at the network"
" or NFS appliance level:"
msgstr ""
"Para un acceso NFS resiliente entre sitios, configure multipath a nivel "
"de red o del appliance NFS:"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/stretch_clusters.rst:255
msgid ""
"**Active/Active NFS endpoints** — If your NFS solution provides multiple "
"access points (e.g., data LIFs across sites), configure DNS round-robin "
"or a load-balanced VIP that routes to the nearest healthy endpoint"
msgstr ""
"**Endpoints NFS activo/activo** — Si su solución NFS proporciona "
"múltiples puntos de acceso (p. ej., LIF de datos entre sitios), configure"
" round-robin DNS o una VIP con balanceo de carga que enrute al endpoint "
"sano más cercano"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/stretch_clusters.rst:256
msgid ""
"**Active/Passive failover** — If the NFS appliance fails over between "
"sites, ensure the failover IP/VIP is consistent and that hosts reconnect "
"automatically after failover (standard NFS client behavior with ``hard`` "
"mount option)"
msgstr ""
"**Conmutación por error activo/pasivo** — Si el appliance NFS conmuta por"
" error entre sitios, asegúrese de que la IP/VIP de conmutación por error "
"sea consistente y de que los hosts se reconecten automáticamente después "
"de la conmutación por error (comportamiento estándar del cliente NFS con "
"la opción de montaje ``hard``)"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/stretch_clusters.rst:257
msgid ""
"**Synchronous replication** — For read/write access from both sites "
"simultaneously, the NFS backend must support synchronous replication. "
"Asynchronous replication introduces the risk of data loss on site "
"failure."
msgstr ""
"**Replicación síncrona** — Para acceso de lectura/escritura desde ambos "
"sitios simultáneamente, el backend NFS debe admitir replicación síncrona."
" La replicación asíncrona introduce el riesgo de pérdida de datos ante un"
" fallo del sitio."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/stretch_clusters.rst:259
msgid "Tip"
msgstr "Consejo"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/stretch_clusters.rst:261
msgid ""
"Use the ``hard`` and ``intr`` NFS mount options in production to ensure "
"clients wait for the NFS server to recover rather than returning errors "
"to applications during brief network interruptions."
msgstr ""
"Use las opciones de montaje NFS ``hard`` e ``intr`` en producción para "
"que los clientes esperen a que el servidor NFS se recupere en lugar de "
"devolver errores a las aplicaciones durante interrupciones breves de red."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/stretch_clusters.rst:264
msgid "Failover Behavior"
msgstr "Comportamiento de conmutación por error"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/stretch_clusters.rst:266
msgid ""
"Unlike the shared LUN model (which uses Corosync/DLM quorum and active "
"fencing), NFS-based stretch clusters rely on:"
msgstr ""
"A diferencia del modelo de LUN compartido (que usa quórum Corosync/DLM y "
"fencing activo), los clústers stretch basados en NFS dependen de:"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/stretch_clusters.rst:268
msgid ""
"**NFS appliance failover** — The storage layer handles its own HA. When "
"the NFS endpoint fails over, hosts reconnect and I/O resumes."
msgstr ""
"**Conmutación por error del appliance NFS** — La capa de almacenamiento "
"gestiona su propio HA. Cuando el endpoint NFS conmuta por error, los "
"hosts se reconectan y se reanuda la E/S."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/stretch_clusters.rst:269
msgid ""
"**|morpheus| host monitoring** — |morpheus| detects host unreachability "
"and can trigger workload migration to surviving hosts (via Dynamic "
"Placement policies)."
msgstr ""
"**Monitoreo de hosts de |morpheus|** — |morpheus| detecta la "
"inaccesibilidad del host y puede desencadenar la migración de cargas de "
"trabajo a hosts supervivientes (mediante políticas Dynamic Placement)."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/stretch_clusters.rst:270
msgid ""
"**No fencing required** — Since NFS handles locking at the protocol level"
" (NLM/NFSv4 leases), there is no risk of split-brain data corruption that"
" requires active fencing."
msgstr ""
"**No se requiere fencing** — Como NFS gestiona el bloqueo a nivel de "
"protocolo (concesiones NLM/NFSv4), no hay riesgo de corrupción de datos "
"por split-brain que requiera fencing activo."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/stretch_clusters.rst:272
msgid "If a full site fails:"
msgstr "Si falla un sitio completo:"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/stretch_clusters.rst:274
msgid "|morpheus| detects hosts at the failed site as unreachable"
msgstr "|morpheus| detecta los hosts del sitio fallido como inaccesibles"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/stretch_clusters.rst:275
msgid ""
"If Dynamic Placement is enabled with appropriate aggressiveness, "
"workloads are automatically migrated to surviving hosts"
msgstr ""
"Si Dynamic Placement está habilitado con la agresividad adecuada, las "
"cargas de trabajo se migran automáticamente a hosts supervivientes"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/stretch_clusters.rst:276
msgid ""
"Manual migration can be triggered by placing a host into maintenance mode"
" (``Infrastructure > Servers > [Host] > Actions > Enter Maintenance``). "
"This live-migrates running VMs and moves powered-off VMs to other "
"available hosts in the cluster."
msgstr ""
"La migración manual puede iniciarse poniendo un host en modo de "
"mantenimiento (``Infrastructure > Servers > [Host] > Actions > Enter "
"Maintenance``). Esto migra en vivo las VMs en ejecución y mueve las VMs "
"apagadas a otros hosts disponibles del clúster."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/stretch_clusters.rst:277
msgid ""
"When the failed site recovers, hosts rejoin the cluster and become "
"available for workload placement again"
msgstr ""
"Cuando el sitio fallido se recupera, los hosts vuelven a unirse al "
"clúster y quedan disponibles de nuevo para la colocación de cargas de "
"trabajo"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/stretch_clusters.rst:280
msgid "Limitations"
msgstr "Limitaciones"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/stretch_clusters.rst:282
msgid ""
"**Performance** — NFS adds network overhead compared to local/Ceph "
"storage. Cross-site NFS access is subject to network latency."
msgstr ""
"**Rendimiento** — NFS añade sobrecarga de red frente al almacenamiento "
"local/Ceph. El acceso NFS entre sitios está sujeto a la latencia de red."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/stretch_clusters.rst:283
msgid ""
"**No cluster-level quorum** — The cluster does not independently "
"arbitrate site failures. Failover depends on your NFS appliance's HA "
"capabilities and |morpheus| Dynamic Placement settings."
msgstr ""
"**Sin quórum a nivel de clúster** — El clúster no arbitra de forma "
"independiente los fallos de sitio. La conmutación por error depende de "
"las capacidades de HA del appliance NFS y de la configuración Dynamic "
"Placement de |morpheus|."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/stretch_clusters.rst:284
msgid ""
"**Write performance across sites** — If hosts at both sites write to the "
"same NFS volume, write performance is bounded by cross-site network "
"latency (especially with synchronous replication)."
msgstr ""
"**Rendimiento de escritura entre sitios** — Si los hosts en ambos sitios "
"escriben en el mismo volumen NFS, el rendimiento de escritura está "
"limitado por la latencia de red entre sitios (especialmente con "
"replicación síncrona)."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/stretch_clusters.rst:285
msgid ""
"**Not suitable for all workloads** — Latency-sensitive applications "
"(databases, real-time systems) may not perform well on cross-site NFS. "
"Consider placing these workloads on local storage or site-local NFS "
"exports."
msgstr ""
"**No apto para todas las cargas de trabajo** — Las aplicaciones sensibles"
" a la latencia (bases de datos, sistemas en tiempo real) pueden no "
"funcionar bien con NFS entre sitios. Considere colocar estas cargas de "
"trabajo en almacenamiento local o exportaciones NFS locales del sitio."

#~ msgid "Navigate to ``Administration > Integrations > Distributed Workers``"
#~ msgstr "Navegue un ``Administration > Integrations > Distributed Workers``"

